# The healthcheck is one long shell string with quotes inside quotes, and Prettier rewrites it
# into YAML's doubled-single-quote form. That is equivalent to YAML and much harder to read for
# somebody comparing it against a failing container at two in the morning — and this file is read
# under exactly that pressure. Deploy-critical and hand-maintained: left alone on purpose.
docker-compose.yml
